o chat. Could you do me a favor? Tell me what you think about the design. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Everything looks very well organized. The mural on the wall goes with the colors, and the lighting is perfect.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le07ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "30500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I like it too. I wish I knew more about design.  The designer went over her plans, but I didn't understand them at the time.  I went along with her decision.  Now I think it looks great. What are you doing later today? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm going out with a couple of friends. We're having a meal at Angelo's. I wish we were going to Ned's. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  What's going on at Angelo's?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: We're going to listen to some live music. A new band is playing.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le07ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "57000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What's that sound? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  That's a bell for the waiters.  When the bell goes off, it means one shift is over and the next one is beginning. What do you want to order? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I think I'll have lobster. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I wish we served lobster!", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le07ob01re2img05.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le07ob01re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}